\begin{frame}{Data collection}
  Two name generators and two name interpretors:
  \begin{enumerate}
    \item Generators: Name those with whom you share important matters and those with whom you speak F\&C.
    \item Interpretors: What proportion of the time do you speak F\&C with each, and what is each one's ethnicity?
  \end{enumerate}
